  #line-at(72pt, 389.06pt, "range of ultrasound frequencies, and lens geometries can be fabricated in cylindrical, circular or ")
  #line-at(72pt, 416.68pt, "arbitrary shapes owing to the soft and deformable nature of the materials. Because the pumps and ")
  #line-at(72pt, 444.28pt, "control electronics are physically decoupled from the acoustic aperture, and thus removed from ")
  #line-at(72pt, 471.88pt, "the acoustic path, wave modulation remains unaffected by the acoustic scattering from electronic ")
  #line-at(72pt, 499.48pt, "components. Furthermore, the system exhibits strong thermal stability and robust operation under ")
  #line-at(72pt, 527.02pt, "high ultrasonic power, making it well suited for applications requiring both high acoustic intensity ")
  #line-at(72pt, 554.62pt, "and dynamic spatial control.  ")
  #line-at(96pt, 582.22pt, "Phase modulation in the microfluidic lens is achieved by filling its fluidic channels with ")
  #line-at(72pt, 609.82pt, "different liquids (e.g., water and silicone oil) with distinct acoustic velocities (see Supplementary ")
  #line-at(72pt, 637.42pt, "Note 3). In the microfluidic lens, the row channels modulate the phase profile along the ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(485.08pt, 637.42pt, "x")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(490.42pt, 637.42pt, "-direction, ")
  #line-at(72pt, 665.02pt, "while the column channels modulate it along the ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(310.7pt, 665.02pt, "y")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(316.04pt, 665.02pt, "-direction. Together, the two layers form a 2D ")
  #line-at(72pt, 692.64pt, "matrix of binary phase pixels capable of generating a single focal spot, multiple foci, or more ")
