  #line-at(108.02pt, 676.72pt, "The microfluidic lens can also be fabricated in non‑planar geometries. As shown in Fig. 5b, ")
  #line-at(72pt, 704.34pt, "we demonstrate a cylindrical microfluidic lens that spatially modulates the wavefront emitted by ")
